<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="E0505">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="1000C_S0003" variety="S0003">
<name>Cooling</name>
<ttl id="1000C_S0003_72UWX_T0009" variety="T0009">
<name>Water Pump Assembly (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM00000224F000X" category="A" type-id="8000D" name-id="120YY-00" from="200511">
<name>Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM00000224F000X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM00000224F000X_01_0001" proc-id="E0505_____000005200000">
<ptxt>Inspect Water Pump Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that coolant is not leaking from the drain hole.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A128603J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If coolant is leaking, replace the water pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Turn the pulley and check that the bearing is not noisy and does not bind.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A036661J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the bearing is noisy or binds, replace the water pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>